# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lemon Squeezy TEST MODE smoke test — example only. NEVER commit real values.
#
# Copy to `.env.billing-smoke` (gitignored) and fill in. The suite REFUSES to
# start unless every guard below passes; there is no override flag, because the
# failure this prevents is charging a real customer from a test run.
#
#   RUN_LS_SMOKE=1 npm run test:billing:ls-smoke
#
# What the suite may do:   read the store, read variants, compare allowlists,
#                          create/fetch a checkout, fetch a fresh portal URL,
#                          receive a real webhook, cancel/resume a subscription
#                          that ALREADY EXISTS and is tagged with this runId.
# What it will NEVER do:   change a price, a variant, a trial length, a billing
#                          anchor; create or delete a product; upgrade or
#                          downgrade a plan; touch anything in Live mode.
#                          Plan changes are covered by the mocked provider only.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The switch. Absent or not "1" → the suite reports NOT RUN and exits 0.
RUN_LS_SMOKE=""

# TEST MODE API key. A live key must be rejected: the suite calls GET /v1/users
# first and refuses to continue unless the account answers in test mode.
LEMONSQUEEZY_API_KEY=""

# The TEST store id. Must equal the store every object in the run belongs to.
LEMONSQUEEZY_STORE_ID=""

# The TEST variants. Compared against what the store actually returns; a
# mismatch is the test/live graph swap and stops the run.
LEMONSQUEEZY_VARIANT_ID=""
LEMONSQUEEZY_VARIANT_MONTHLY=""
LEMONSQUEEZY_VARIANT_YEARLY=""

# The TEST webhook signing secret, for the real delivery leg.
LEMONSQUEEZY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""

# Must be localhost or a *staging* host. A production hostname stops the run.
SMOKE_BACKEND_URL="http://localhost:8787"

# Must NOT be an Atlas/production cluster. A disposable database only.
DATABASE_URL="mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/welockin_smoke"

# An EXISTING test-mode subscription the run may cancel and resume. Leave empty
# to skip that leg — the suite will never create one to cancel.
SMOKE_QA_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=""
